Z||000001||theogre||05-05-2000||02:13 PM||||unless something is wrong with the 85, or the 87 has differant finals, nothing would be differant enough to be worth the work. (Unless of course you've got it apart for some other reason.)<P>TH125c is the same for pretty much everything that uses it reguardless of year. Differant linkages and brackets are about it and those are changable. The only differance gearing wise that I'm aware of is in the finals. There are about 4-5 differant finals.||||reg||1
